<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: EU summit to resume on EMU pact at 1500 GMT.</title>
<headline>EU summit to resume on EMU pact at 1500 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union leaders and their finance ministers will meet jointly to discuss a stability pact for European monetary union when an EU summit's second session begins at 1500 GMT on Friday, an EU diplomat said.</p>
</text>
